(text "LP output only / ST MB1720 high-band low-power starting values" (at 15 15 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7d7855f5-83f9-5f5d-b7b9-25e87adfb89c"))
(text "RFO_HP is not connected. Firmware must select LP PA and limit FEM input to safe level.\nNormal: NORM parts fitted, FEM parts DNP. High performance: reverse these groups.\n+27 dBm is NOT universally permitted in EU868; enforce regional ERP/EIRP and duty-cycle limits." (at 15 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "765e79d3-8877-5d5f-b4a1-0171ab4ba72f"))
(text "RF switch sleep sequence" (at 205 185 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8163057a-e114-55c6-8f57-3bbe86b210a3"))
(text "PA11 supplies BGS12SN6: 100uA typ / 180uA max active.\nBefore sleep set CTRL LOW, then PA11 LOW.\nWake: PA11 HIGH, wait >=20us, select path. CTRL 0=TX; 1=RX." (at 205 191 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "66043088-7c80-5c87-a8e7-d8d9c38cf72d"))
(text "Tuning / variant isolation" (at 134 253 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6aedc3db-b525-5eae-9868-67af239d01d0"))
(text "All RF capacitors C0G; use high-Q RF inductors. Values start from ST MB1720.\nPopulate only one RF path. Inactive branch begins at its open selector pad.\nRemove antenna-side selector for conducted measurements; do not add a tee stub." (at 134 259 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "495b7b06-a175-509c-b2a0-4c3841c9075f"))
